      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t this generally a step backwards? Is it only for MakeVars? If so, could we either (1) remove the var, it seems it\u0027s only used to pass a file to make; or (2) make it possible for normal modules to expose vars; or (3) maybe just leave the vars declarations in the existing singleton?",
